            "value" : "Readings, raw files, sleep and scores are deleted. Bands and keys stay. Server and Apple Health data are not deleted. Older history will not be exported again."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ölçümler, ham dosyalar, uyku ve skorlar silinir. Bileklikler ve anahtarlar kalır. Sunucu ve Apple Health verileri silinmez. Eski geçmiş yeniden aktarılmaz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Readings, the band's raw files, sleep and scores are deleted. Bands and their keys stay. Data on the server isn't affected." : {
