        }
      }
    },
    "Strain is 21 × ln(1 + load ÷ 25) ÷ ln 25, at most 21: a load of 100 is about 10.5, 200 about 14.3." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
